From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:09:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add ScreenScraper support (developer login compiled in)

EmulationStation only includes the ScreenScraper scraper when
SCREENSCRAPER_DEV_LOGIN is defined at compile time; without it the scraper
does not exist in the menu.

- build.sh: pass SCREENSCRAPER_DEV_LOGIN ("devid=<id>&devpassword=<pw>") and
  SCREENSCRAPER_SOFTNAME (default Retrobox-Emulationstation) to cmake when
  the login is set. The shape is validated without printing the value.
- workflow: read the repository secret SCREENSCRAPER_DEV_LOGIN, mask its two
  values separately, build with it, and make the test job require the scraper
  in the binary when the secret exists. Whether the secret exists is part of
  the release hash, so adding it triggers a new build.
- stage.sh / smoke.sh: BUILDINFO and the test report whether the binary has
  ScreenScraper support.
- README: document how to enable it and that the login ends up in plain text
  in the binary.
---
 .github/workflows/build.yml | 29 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 README.md                   | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 scripts/build.sh            | 30 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 scripts/stage.sh            |  4 ++++
 tests/smoke.sh              |  9 +++++++++
 5 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

